{
  "slug": "stunt-double",
  "name": "Stunt Double",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Stunt Double deploys AI agents with realistic user personas to validate user journeys at scale. Create actors, run automated workflows and checklists against any web app, and surface friction points before real users encounter them.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **5 skills** and **5 agents**.\n\n- **Skills** (5): `create-actor-panel` (Create and configure a Stunt Double actor (AI persona) with knowledge entries for realistic user simulation), `design-review` (Run a design review session by gathering feedback from multiple Stunt Double actors on a proposed design or…), `run-qa-suite` (Run the full Stunt Double QA suite — all workflows and checklists — and produce a release-readiness report), `run-ux-validation` (Validate a user journey by running Stunt Double workflows or checklists and reporting the results), `triage-feedback` (Review, categorize, and manage Stunt Double feedback submissions across projects)\n- **Agents** (5): `design-reviewer` (Facilitate design reviews and co-creation sessions using Stunt Double actors and conversations), `feedback-triager` (Triage, prioritize, and manage Stunt Double feedback to drive UX improvements), `product-researcher` (Gather user insights and validate product hypotheses using Stunt Double actors, conversations, and feedback), `qa-engineer` (Run and monitor Stunt Double checklists and workflows for QA validation of user-facing features), `ux-friction-reviewer` (Review code changes for potential UX friction using Stunt Double personas and feedback)\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install stunt-double@claude-community` from `stunt-double/stuntdouble-mcp`.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude",
    "copilot"
  ],
  "pluginType": "package",
  "package": {
    "skill": 5,
    "agent": 5
  },
